v class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 09-08-2019, 05:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T02:30:36-07:00","id":1334429,"title":"","content":"For the<b> Pirates of Pugmire</b> and adventures on Acid Seas - I recommend <b>Captain Claw</b> video game about cat pirate!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://igg-games.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/10/Captain-Claw-Free-Download.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Here all the cutscenes! ( So you do not need to play it, if you don't want. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cKF3IVqljTk\" data-code=\"cKF3IVqljTk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/cKF3IVqljTk/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T09:51:02-07:00","id":1386421,"title":"","content":"I was pointed by fellow fans for this as possible <b>Realms of Pugmire</b> creations stories. Now it's on my must read/listen list! Some sum up of book:<br /> <br /> <i>'Simak's &quot;City&quot; is a series of connected stories, a series of legends, myths, and campfire stories told by Dogs about the end of human civilization, centering on the Webster family, who, among their other accomplishments, designed the ships that took Men to the stars and gave Dogs the gift of speech and robots to be their hands.'</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/222093.City?fbclid=IwAR10D3czHlLPjP7obb3Hqda7dST8A2DYNeS3GYMkeZ6wVphCdCQxJMoM5Kc\" target=\"_blank\">'City' on Goodreads</a><br /> <br /> Topic it as RoP setting inspiration - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1274256-city-by-clifford-d-simak-as-realms-of-pugmire-universe-inspiration\">is here </a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T10:18:12-07:00","id":1386427,"title":"","content":"<i>There is dark new cult in Monarchies. Deviant groups of Cats want to summon Unseen demon possessing Dog incarnation, foretelling end of all of Animal Races. Who will stop them? Maybe your new litter of adventurers?</i><br /> <br /> Yes, it's chronicle idea loosely based on psychodelic video game about lone Cat fighting Satan's Dog - <b>PUSS! </b>( <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/719750/PUSS/\" target=\"_blank\">See it on Steam</a> - You had been warned. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> Picked original materials from the game for inspirations. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/laCxNA3.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Cerberus - Demonic Chihuahua!</b></span></span> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( First Boss fight )<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RcKBXkhLA8k\" data-code=\"RcKBXkhLA8k\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/RcKBXkhLA8k/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1252601-mau-chronicle-idea-dog-unseen-cult-puss-video-game\">Whole topic for this idea as chronicle - here</a></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0